---
name: email-templater
description: 生成专业邮件模板
---

```python
def generate_email(email_type, key_info):
    templates = {
        "follow_up": "Dear {name}, Following up on...",
        "thank_you": "Dear {name}, Thank you for...",
    }
    return templates.get(email_type, "").format(**key_info)
```
